  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503370,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My jacket is waterproof, so I was fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506010,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But my jeans are\nabsolutely soaked through."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510000,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] To study landslides,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511200,
    "dDurationMs": 3123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the whole warehouse\nhas a secret, it moves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517560,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Peter] The rainfall simulator can be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519750,
    "dDurationMs": 2283,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in one of five positions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522870,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Velocity is about one\nmeter per one minute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529080,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- One meter per minute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 530400,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, it moves on these railway tracks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533220,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every time you move it, you need"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534960,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to grab this gigantic\nwrench and undo these bolts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540270,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the pipe that connects"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544350,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all the water up to the sprinklers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546870,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a number of these kind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549180,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of openings in the pipe along the line."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552300,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when you move it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553530,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you just connect it to a different part."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557640,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is the landslide testing facility?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560310,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yes, this is a 30 degree\nslope, you can see this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565230,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a shallow landslide."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567630,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you can put the soil\nhere, about one meter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573330,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Petr] You would put all\nthe sand and all the soil,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577470,
    "dDurationMs": 2583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then you'd bring the building over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581040,
    "dDurationMs": 1233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You'd move it over here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583140,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then you'd start raining on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584970,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592122,
    "dDurationMs": 2418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Dr. Sakai] 20 degrees\nthis slope, is 20 degrees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594540,
    "dDurationMs": 3567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Right, so you have a 30, a 40, and a 20,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598107,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "20, 30, 40.\n- Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600150,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] So what causes landslides?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602850,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, a slope will slide when the force"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604710,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of gravity pulling it down becomes greater"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607110,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than the force of friction holding it up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609540,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There's a misnomer out there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610830,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that water makes the materials\nslipperier, so it rains"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615000,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it soaks into the ground\nand it makes it slipperier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617130,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's not true, water's\nactually an anti lubricant"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619980,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for many materials, including quartz,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622410,
    "dDurationMs": 4923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is our most common\nmineral in soils and on earth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628710,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] So water doesn't\nmake soil slipperier,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631470,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but soil is porous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633450,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are grains and there are\npores between those grains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637200,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as it rains, the\nwater seeps into the soil,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640050,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the pores become filled with water,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642540,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and as it keeps raining,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643590,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the water pressure in the pores increases,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646020,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which decreases the\nfriction between the grains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649530,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For a slope that was\nalready at risk of sliding,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652290,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this decrease in friction\nis what ultimately leads"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654900,
    "dDurationMs": 2853,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the slope breaking\napart and sliding downhill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659340,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- One thing that our\nmathematical models are not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662220,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "very well developed at yet is determining"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665370,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is it going to slide slowly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667640,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or is it going to slide\nor maybe flow rapidly?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670800,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a tough one, that's, so\nexperimentation's a great way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675300,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of getting at that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676500,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you know, the scaler effects are huge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 679410,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So many people have a\nlittle model in their lab,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682080,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, a small scale flume,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684270,
    "dDurationMs": 1797,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but now you're dealing\nwith materials, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686067,
    "dDurationMs": 2583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're starting to get off scale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688650,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A large scale stimulation\ndevice like they have in Japan"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692490,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is really important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 695010,
    "dDurationMs": 2373,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] So how can\nyou prevent landslides?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698550,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, there are a few things you can do,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700380,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like using steel beams and\nmesh to anchor the slope."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703560,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or you can dig up the\ntop layer of the soil"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705750,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to decrease the slope angle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707760,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when it's expected\nthat a slope will slide"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 709650,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after too much rain, engineers\ndrill holes into the slope"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712710,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and place pipes to drain the water out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715980,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another solution is to\ncreate catchment zones"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718470,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and diversion channels,\nbig holes in the ground"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721140,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that will catch or divert the landslide"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722940,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before it hits a residential area."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 725850,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Trees are incredibly effective\nat preventing landslides."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728940,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not only do their roots\nprovide great anchors,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731490,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they draw the water up from\nthe soil to be evaporated away,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735390,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which effectively drains the soil"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 736890,
    "dDurationMs": 1853,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and decreases the water level."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 740458,
    "dDurationMs": 3083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(chainsaw operating)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748710,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where steep slopes have been deforested"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 750870,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the timber industry,\nlandslides have become more common."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754290,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Over the last few decades,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755490,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there has been a tenfold\nincrease in landslides"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 758310,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the forests of British Columbia."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761520,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Humans are really good\nat causing landslides"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764190,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we're shaping the land a heck"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765570,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a lot more quickly than\ngeologic processes do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768480,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when we excavate over\nhere or add more weight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772200,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or more landslide or\nmore material over here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775380,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that triggers landslides\nvery, very regularly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 778680,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Study in Seattle from Seattle,\nWashington a few decades ago,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 782280,
    "dDurationMs": 2429,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "showed that I think more than 85%"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 784709,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had at least partial human\ntrigger, if you will."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794717,
    "dDurationMs": 1336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] While the focus\nof the work is primarily"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796053,
    "dDurationMs": 2307,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on landslide study and prevention,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 798360,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the simulator is also used to test"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800190,
    "dDurationMs": 3153,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how drones fly in rainy\nand windy conditions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804780,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's also used to test self-driving cars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 807570,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The data is used to improve the hardware"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809580,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and software of how the\ncars detect various objects."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 813030,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The two main ways that self-driving\ncars detect other cars,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816060,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "traffic lights and\npedestrians is with cameras"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818850,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or LIDAR sensors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 820680,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In both cases, rain can\ndecrease the visibility"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823470,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and accuracy of these sensors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825690,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So testing them in a perfectly\nrepeatable environment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 828480,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "helps engineers develop solutions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830520,
    "dDurationMs": 1623,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to these weather challenges."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834660,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- In Japan, the rainfall\ncondition is changing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 837600,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now in this century,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839760,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the rainfall condition\nis so many heavy rainfall"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843540,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in so much short time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847160,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] As the world heats\nup due to humanity's addiction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849720,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to fossil fuels,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 850680,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "extreme weather events\nare becoming more common."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853320,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Compared to 30 years ago, the\nnumber of rain events in Japan"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 856230,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with an intensity of\n50 millimeters per hour"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858870,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have become 40% more common."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861300,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Rainfall at double"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862500,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that intensity has become 70% more common."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865740,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Climate change will increase\nthe rate of flooding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 868050,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the occurrence of\nlandslides in the future,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870360,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is why the work done"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 871410,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the world's largest rainfall\nsimulator is becoming more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 874470,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and more important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 876000,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I hope that humanity\nfocuses its efforts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 878190,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on addressing the root\ncauses of climate change"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 880950,
    "dDurationMs": 3273,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and not just on the mitigation\nof its negative impacts."
    } ]
  } ]
}
